answer:
Perfect brief — let's lean into the underexposed aesthetic and make those grainy photos feel intentional. Here's a gritty neon poster layout:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>NEON VOID — Poster Proof</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --void-black: #08080c;
      --deep-navy: #0d1117;
      --neon-cyan: #00fff7;
      --neon-magenta: #ff0080;
      --neon-violet: #b000ff;
      --acid-green: #c8ff00;
      --slate-overlay: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.85);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      background: var(--void-black);
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .font-display {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    }

    /* Grain texture overlay */
    .grain-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 100;
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    /* Poster container */
    .poster {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--void-black);
    }

    /* Photo base layer */
    .photo-layer {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #1a1a2e 0%,
        #0d1117 50%,
        #0a0a12 100%
      );
    }

    .photo-layer img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(0.6) contrast(1.3) saturate(0.8);
      mix-blend-mode: screen;
    }

    /* Semi-transparent color blocks */
    .color-block {
      position: absolute;
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    }

    .block-cyan {
      background: rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.15);
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    }

    .block-magenta {
      background: rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.12);
    }

    .block-violet {
      background: rgba(176, 0, 255, 0.1);
    }

    /* Headline typography */
    .headline {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(80px, 20vw, 280px);
      line-height: 0.85;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--neon-cyan);
      text-shadow: 
        0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.5),
        0 0 80px rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.3);
    }

    .headline-filled {
      color: var(--void-black);
      -webkit-text-stroke: 3px var(--neon-magenta);
      text-shadow: 
        4px 4px 0 rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.4),
        -2px -2px 0 rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.3);
    }

    .headline-solid {
      color: white;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 0;
      text-shadow: 
        0 0 60px rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.8),
        0 0 120px rgba(176, 0, 255, 0.5);
    }

    /* Overlapping type */
    .type-layer-1 {
      position: absolute;
      top: 10%;
      left: -5%;
      transform: rotate(-8deg);
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .type-layer-2 {
      position: absolute;
      top: 25%;
      right: -10%;
      transform: rotate(5deg);
      z-index: 20;
    }

    .type-layer-3 {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 20%;
      left: 5%;
      transform: rotate(-3deg);
      z-index: 15;
    }

    /* Semi-transparent info panels */
    .info-panel {
      background: var(--slate-overlay);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    }

    .info-panel-cyan {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--neon-cyan);
    }

    .info-panel-magenta {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--neon-magenta);
    }

    /* Glitch-style accent lines */
    .glitch-line {
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        transparent 0%,
        var(--neon-cyan) 20%,
        var(--neon-magenta) 50%,
        var(--neon-violet) 80%,
        transparent 100%
      );
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    /* Neon text accent */
    .neon-text-cyan {
      color: var(--neon-cyan);
      text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.6);
    }

    .neon-text-magenta {
      color: var(--neon-magenta);
      text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.6);
    }

    /* Vertical text */
    .vertical-text {
      writing-mode: vertical-rl;
      text-orientation: mixed;
      transform: rotate(180deg);
    }

    /* Scanline effect */
    .scanlines {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        0deg,
        transparent,
        transparent 2px,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 2px,
        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 4px
      );
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 50;
    }

    /* Date/time display */
    .datetime-display {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 6rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      background: linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        var(--neon-cyan) 0%,
        var(--neon-magenta) 100%
      );
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }

    /* Reduced motion */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .headline,
      .type-layer-1,
      .type-layer-2,
      .type-layer-3 {
        transform: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- SVG Grain Texture -->
  <svg class="grain-overlay" viewBox="0 0 200 200" preserveAspectRatio="none">
    <filter id="noise">
      <feTurbulence 
        type="fractalNoise" 
        baseFrequency="0.85" 
        numOctaves="4" 
        stitchTiles="stitch"
      />
      <feColorMatrix type="saturate" values="0"/>
    </filter>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" filter="url(#noise)"/>
  </svg>

  <div class="poster">
    <!-- Photo base (replace src with your underexposed photo) -->
    <div class="photo-layer">
      <!-- Placeholder gradient simulating dark concert photo -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: 
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 40%, rgba(176, 0, 255, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 60%, rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.1) 0%, transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%, rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.12) 0%, transparent 45%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #08080c 0%, #0d1117 100%);">
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Semi-transparent color blocks -->
    <div class="color-block block-cyan" style="width: 45%; height: 60%; top: 5%; left: -5%; transform: skewY(-6deg);"></div>
    <div class="color-block block-magenta" style="width: 50%; height: 40%; bottom: 10%; right: -8%; transform: skewY(4deg);"></div>
    <div class="color-block block-violet" style="width: 30%; height: 70%; top: 20%; left: 35%; transform: skewX(-3deg);"></div>

    <!-- Scanlines overlay -->
    <div class="scanlines"></div>

    <!-- Layer 1: Outlined headline (back) -->
    <div class="type-layer-1">
      <h1 class="headline">DEAD</h1>
      <h1 class="headline" style="margin-left: 15%; margin-top: -0.15em;">CHANNEL</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Layer 2: Filled headline overlapping -->
    <div class="type-layer-2">
      <h1 class="headline headline-filled">LIVE</h1>
      <h1 class="headline headline-filled" style="margin-left: -10%; margin-top: -0.1em;">AT</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Layer 3: Solid white headline (front) -->
    <div class="type-layer-3">
      <h1 class="headline headline-solid">NEON</h1>
      <h1 class="headline headline-solid" style="margin-left: 20%; margin-top: -0.2em;">VOID</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Vertical accent text -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 right-6 vertical-text">
      <span class="font-display text-6xl md:text-8xl tracking-widest" style="color: rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.3);">
        NOVEMBER 2024
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Left side vertical text -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 left-4 vertical-text">
      <span class="text-xs md:text-sm tracking-widest" style="color: rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.5);">
        DOORS 8PM // NO FLASH // 21+
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Date/Time panel -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30">
      <div class="info-panel info-panel-cyan text-center">
        <div class="datetime-display">11.22</div>
        <div class="glitch-line my-3"></div>
        <p class="text-white text-sm md:text-base tracking-widest">FRIDAY NIGHT</p>
        <p class="neon-text-magenta text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold mt-1">DOORS 8PM</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Venue info -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-8 right-8 z-30">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-4">

        <div class="info-panel info-panel-magenta">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest mb-1" style="color: var(--neon-cyan);">VENUE</p>
          <p class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white">THE BASMENT</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">142 UNDERGROUND ST, BK</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-panel" style="border-left: 3px solid var(--acid-green);">
          <p class="text-xs tracking-widest mb-1" style="color: var(--acid-green);">COVER</p>
          <p class="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl neon-text-cyan">$15</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">CASH / VENMO @basmentshows</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Top accent line -->
    <div class="absolute top-8 left-0 right-0 h-px z-40" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, var(--neon-magenta) 50%, transparent 100%);"></div>

    <!-- Supporting acts -->
    <div class="absolute top-12 left-8 z-30">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-widest mb-3" style="color: var(--neon-violet);">SUPPORTING</p>
      <p class="font-display text-xl md:text-3xl text-white mb-1">GLITCH MOTH</p>
      <p class="font-display text-xl md:text-3xl text-white mb-1">STATIC BLOOM</p>
      <p class="font-display text-xl md:text-3xl text-white">VOID PROTOCOL</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom corner accent -->
    <svg class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 md:w-48 md:h-48 z-20" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none">
      <path d="M100 0 L100 100 L0 100" stroke="var(--neon-cyan)" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none" opacity="0.4"/>
      <path d="M100 20 L100 100 L20 100" stroke="var(--neon-magenta)" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none" opacity="0.3"/>
      <path d="M100 40 L100 100 L40 100" stroke="var(--neon-violet)" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none" opacity="0.2"/>
    </svg>

    <!-- Top left corner accent -->
    <svg class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 z-20" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none">
      <rect x="10" y="10" width="40" height="40" stroke="var(--neon-cyan)" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none" opacity="0.5" transform="rotate(45 30 30)"/>
      <rect x="15" y="15" width="30" height="30" stroke="var(--neon-magenta)" stroke-width="0.5" fill="none" opacity="0.4" transform="rotate(45 30 30)"/>
    </svg>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
```

---

## Color Palette

| Name | Hex | Usage |
|------|-----|-------|
| Void Black | `#08080c` | Deep background base |
| Deep Navy | `#0d1117` | Panel backgrounds, overlays |
| Neon Cyan | `#00fff7` | Primary accent, outlines, glows |
| Neon Magenta | `#ff0080` | Secondary accent, fills |
| Neon Violet | `#b000ff` | Tertiary accent, depth |
| Acid Green | `#c8ff00` | Highlight accent |

---

## Key Design Moves

1. **Overlapping Type** — Three headline layers with different treatments (outline, filled-stroke, solid) at skewed angles. The illegibility is intentional — you read "NEON VOID" but the chaos reads "gritty show."

2. **Semi-transparent Blocks** — The skewed color blocks use `mix-blend-mode: multiply` with low opacity. They'll tint your dark photos without obscuring them.

3. **Grain Layer** — The SVG noise filter sits on top, which makes your underexposed photos look intentional rather than accidental.

4. **Your Photo Goes Here** — Replace the gradient in `.photo-layer` with:
```html
<img src="your-grainy-concert-photo.jpg" alt="">
```

The `filter: brightness(0.6) contrast(1.3) saturate(0.8)` + `mix-blend-mode: screen` will pull detail out of dark shots while keeping the noir vibe.

