---

## Color Palette Reference

| Name | Hex | Usage |
|------|-----|-------|
| Void Black | `#050505` | Deep base, shadows |
| Deep Charcoal | `#0f0f0f` | Subtle block backgrounds |
| Neon Magenta | `#ff0066` | Primary accent, glows |
| Electric Cyan | `#00fff7` | Secondary accent, outlines |
| Toxic Lime | `#c8ff00` | Highlight, date callout |
| Burnt Orange | `#ff4d00` | Accent (available) |
| Ghost White | `#f0f0f0` | Typography, lines |

---

## How to Use Your Photos

Replace the `.image-layer` background with your actual photo:

```css
.image-layer {
  background: 
    linear-gradient(180deg, 
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.2) 30%,
      rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.85) 70%,
      var(--void-black) 100%
    ),
    url('your-photo.jpg');
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  filter: brightness(0.5) contrast(1.4) saturate(0.8);
}
```

The gradient overlay fades your grainy photo into the black base naturally, and the filter pushes contrast to make underexposure look intentional.

---

## Key Design Decisions

1. **Overlapping type** — The "LIVE" text rotates behind the headline, and the outlined "VOID" creates depth without competing
2. **Semi-transparent blocks** — Set to `mix-blend-mode: screen` so they interact with your photo's tones
3. **Grain overlay** — Adds texture that unifies the photo grain with the digital elements
4. **Controlled illegibility** — Vertical text, glitch effects, and skewed blocks add chaos while the core info (date, venue, band name) stays readable
5. **Neon glow via box-shadow** — The poster container itself glows, making it feel like a lit marquee

Perfect brief for a gritty neon poster. Let me build you something that leans into the "bad photo" problem and turns it into a feature. The design uses aggressive overlapping type, semi-transparent color blocks with blend modes, and a noise texture that'll make those underexposed shots look intentional.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Indie Show Poster Proof</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* ========================================
       COLOR PALETTE (exact hex values)
       ======================================== */
    :root {
      --bg-deep: #05050a;
      --bg-mid: #0d0d14;
      --neon-cyan: #00fff7;
      --neon-magenta: #ff0066;
      --neon-yellow: #d4ff00;
      --neon-orange: #ff4400;
      --text-white: #f0f0f0;
      --text-muted: #888899;
      --block-cyan: rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.12);
      --block-magenta: rgba(255, 0, 102, 0.15);
      --block-yellow: rgba(212, 255, 0, 0.1);
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--bg-deep);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ========================================
       POSTER FRAME
       ======================================== */
    .poster-frame {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      aspect-ratio: 2/3;
      position: relative;
      background: var(--bg-mid);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 
        0 0 60px rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.1),
        0 0 120px rgba(255, 0, 102, 0.05);
    }

    /* ========================================
       NOISE TEXTURE OVERLAY (SVG filter)
       ======================================== */
    .noise-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 100;
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    /* ========================================
       BACKGROUND IMAGE PLACEHOLDER
       ======================================== */
    .bg-image {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: 
        linear-gradient(180deg, 
          transparent 0%, 
          rgba(5, 5, 10, 0.3) 50%,
          rgba(5, 5, 10, 0.8) 100%
        ),
        url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 600"><rect fill="%230d0d14" width="400" height="600"/><circle cx="200" cy="300" r="150" fill="%231a1a24"/><circle cx="120" cy="200" r="80" fill="%23141420"/><circle cx="280" cy="400" r="100" fill="%23181822"/></svg>');
      background-size: cover;
      filter: brightness(0.6) contrast(1.2);
    }

    /* Drop your photo here */
    .bg-image::after {
      content: 'DROP PHOTO HERE';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    /* ========================================
       SEMI-TRANSPARENT BLOCKS
       ======================================== */
    .block {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .block--cyan {
      top: 15%;
      left: -5%;
      width: 60%;
      height: 25%;
      background: var(--block-cyan);
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
      border-right: 2px solid var(--neon-cyan);
      transform: skewX(-8deg);
    }

    .block--magenta {
      bottom: 25%;
      right: -10%;
      width: 55%;
      height: 20%;
      background: var(--block-magenta);
      backdrop-filter: blur(1px);
      border-left: 2px solid var(--neon-magenta);
      transform: skewX(-6deg);
    }

    .block--yellow {
      bottom: 8%;
      left: 5%;
      width: 40%;
      height: 12%;
      background: var(--block-yellow);
      border-right: 2px solid var(--neon-yellow);
    }

    .block--scan {
      top: 0;
      left: 20%;
      width: 1px;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        transparent 0%,
        var(--neon-cyan) 20%,
        var(--neon-cyan) 80%,
        transparent 100%
      );
      opacity: 0.3;
    }

    /* ========================================
       TYPOGRAPHY - OVERLAPPING HEADLINE
       ======================================== */
    .headline {
      position: absolute;
      top: 8%;
      left: -2%;
      z-index: 30;
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 18vw, 9rem);
      line-height: 0.85;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--text-white);
      mix-blend-mode: hard-light;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .headline__line {
      display: block;
    }

    .headline__line--1 {
      color: var(--neon-cyan);
      text-shadow: 
        3px 3px 0 var(--neon-magenta),
        -1px -1px 0 var(--bg-deep);
      transform: translateX(5%);
    }

    .headline__line--2 {
      color: var(--text-white);
      text-shadow: 
        4px 4px 0 var(--neon-cyan),
        -2px -2px 0 var(--neon-magenta);
      transform: translateX(15%);
      mix-blend-mode: exclusion;
    }

    .headline__line--3 {
      color: var(--neon-magenta);
      text-shadow: 
        2px 2px 0 var(--neon-yellow),
        -1px -1px 0 var(--bg-deep);
      transform: translateX(8%);
    }

    /* ========================================
       SECONDARY TYPE - VENUE / DATE
       ======================================== */
    .meta {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 40;
    }

    .meta--venue {
      bottom: 28%;
      right: 5%;
      text-align: right;
      transform: rotate(-90deg) translateY(100%);
      transform-origin: right bottom;
    }

    .meta--date {
      bottom: 10%;
      left: 8%;
    }

    .meta__label {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .meta__value {
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--neon-yellow);
      text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--neon-yellow);
    }

    .meta--date .meta__value {
      color: var(--neon-cyan);
      text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--neon-cyan);
    }

    /* ========================================
       ACCENT TYPE - BLEEDING OFF
       ======================================== */
    .accent-text {
      position: absolute;
      top: 55%;
      right: -5%;
      z-index: 25;
      font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 12vw, 6rem);
      color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--neon-magenta);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    /* ========================================
       SMALL INFO BLOCK
       ======================================== */
    .info-block {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 3%;
      right: 3%;
      z-index: 50;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .info-block__line {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.55rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
    }

    .info-block__line--highlight {
      color: var(--neon-orange);
    }

    /* ========================================
       DECORATIVE ELEMENTS
       ======================================== */
    .deco-line {
      position: absolute;
      background: var(--neon-cyan);
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .deco-line--h {
      height: 1px;
      width: 30%;
      top: 52%;
      left: 0;
    }

    .deco-line--v {
      width: 1px;
      height: 20%;
      bottom: 15%;
      right: 25%;
      background: var(--neon-magenta);
    }

    /* ========================================
       TICKET STUB NOTCH
       ======================================== */
    .stub-notch {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 20%;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        transparent 0px,
        transparent 8px,
        var(--bg-deep) 8px,
        var(--bg-deep) 16px
      );
      z-index: 60;
    }

    /* ========================================
       ANIMATION - SUBTLE FLICKER
       ======================================== */
    @keyframes flicker {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      92% { opacity: 1; }
      93% { opacity: 0.8; }
      94% { opacity: 1; }
      96% { opacity: 0.9; }
      97% { opacity: 1; }
    }

    .headline__line--1,
    .meta__value {
      animation: flicker 4s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes scan {
      0% { transform: translateY(-100%); }
      100% { transform: translateY(100%); }
    }

    /* ========================================
       CODE DISPLAY (for copying)
       ======================================== */
    .code-section {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .code-section h2 {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    .color-swatches {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .swatch {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.5rem;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .swatch__color {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    .swatch__info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .swatch__name {
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .swatch__hex {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--text-white);
    }

    .code-block {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      padding: 1rem;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--neon-cyan);
      overflow-x: auto;
      white-space: pre;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .code-block .comment {
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .code-block .property {
      color: var(--neon-magenta);
    }

    .code-block .value {
      color: var(--neon-yellow);
    }

    /* ========================================
       REDUCED MOTION
       ======================================== */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .headline__line--1,
      .meta__value {
        animation: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- SVG FILTERS (defined globally for reuse) -->
  <svg style="position: absolute; width: 0; height: 0;">
    <defs>
      <filter id="noise">
        <feTurbulence 
          type="fractalNoise" 
          baseFrequency="0.85" 
          numOctaves="4" 
          stitchTiles="stitch"
          result="noise"
        />
        <feColorMatrix 
          type="saturate" 
          values="0"
          in="noise" 
          result="mono"
        />
        <feBlend in="SourceGraphic" in2="mono" mode="multiply"/>
      </filter>
    </defs>
  </svg>

  <!-- POSTER -->
  <div class="poster-frame">
    <!-- Background photo area -->
    <div class="bg-image"></div>

    <!-- Noise overlay -->
    <svg class="noise-overlay" viewBox="0 0 200 300" preserveAspectRatio="none">
      <filter id="noise-filter">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.9" numOctaves="3" result="noise"/>
        <feColorMatrix type="saturate" values="0"/>
      </filter>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" filter="url(#noise-filter)"/>
    </svg>

    <!-- Semi-transparent blocks -->
    <div class="block block--cyan"></div>
    <div class="block block--magenta"></div>
    <div class="block block--yellow"></div>
    <div class="block block--scan"></div>

    <!-- Decorative lines -->
    <div class="deco-line deco-line--h"></div>
    <div class="deco-line deco-line--v"></div>

    <!-- Stub notch -->
    <div class="stub-notch"></div>

    <!-- Main headline - overlapping -->
    <div class="headline">
      <span class="headline__line headline__line--1">NEON</span>
      <span class="headline__line headline__line--2">GRAVE</span>
      <span class="headline__line headline__line--3">YARD</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Rotated accent text -->
    <div class="accent-text">LIVE</div>

    <!-- Meta info -->
    <div class="meta meta--venue">
      <div class="meta__label">Venue</div>
      <div class="meta__value">THE BASEMENT</div>
    </div>

    <div class="meta meta--date">
      <div class="meta__label">Date</div>
      <div class="meta__value">DEC 14</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Small info -->
    <div class="info-block">
      <div class="info-block__line">Doors 8PM / $15</div>
      <div class="info-block__line info-block__line--highlight">All Ages</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CODE SNIPPETS FOR COPYING -->
  <section class="code-section">
    <h2>Color Palette</h2>
    <div class="color-swatches">
      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="swatch__color" style="background: #00fff7;"></div>
