    </div>

    <h2>Semi-Transparent Blocks CSS</h2>
    <div class="code-block"><span class="comment">/* Cyan block */</span>
<span class="property">background</span>: <span class="value">rgba(0, 255, 247, 0.12)</span>;
<span class="property">backdrop-filter</span>: <span class="value">blur(2px)</span>;
